Description: Microsoft-compatible KMS server emulator
 vlmcsd is an independent implementation of a Microsoft KMS (Key Management
 Service) server. It speaks KMS protocol versions 4, 5 and 6 and activates
 Windows and Office volume license products.
 .
 KMS activation is not permanent. Clients must re-activate every 180 days,
 so a KMS server has to stay reachable in the network.
